From: Fransis <fransis@pocknix>
Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: qcom_battmgr: usar opcode 0x16 (USB_CHARGE_NOW) en vez de 0x33 para activar carga

El firmware del Odin 3 (SM8750) responde "unknown message 0x33" cuando se le
envia BATTMGR_USB_PROPERTY_SET (0x33) para controlar usb_charge_now. Por
desensamblado del driver Android qti_battery_charger.ko se descubrio que el
firmware espera el opcode 0x16 (22) para usb_charge_now (y 0x20 para
charge_control_en, no 0x48).

El layout del mensaje es identico al mainline (owner+type+opcode+battery+
property+value, 24 bytes); la unica diferencia es el valor del opcode.

Signed-off-by: Fransis <fransis@pocknix>
---
 drivers/power/supply/qcom_battmgr.c | 13 +++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/power/supply/qcom_battmgr.c b/drivers/power/supply/qcom_battmgr.c
--- a/drivers/power/supply/qcom_battmgr.c	2026-09-09 12:00:04.717320921 +0200
+++ drivers/power/supply/qcom_battmgr.c	2026-09-09 12:00:04.726003500 +0200
@@ -94,6 +94,14 @@
  */
 #define USB_CHARGE_ENABLE		14
 
+/*
+ * Opcode REAL del firmware para controlar usb_charge_now (descubierto por
+ * desensamblado del driver Android qti_battery_charger.ko: el firmware del
+ * Odin 3 NO usa BATTMGR_USB_PROPERTY_SET (0x33); espera este opcode 0x16).
+ * Con 0x33 el firmware responde "unknown message 0x33".
+ */
+#define BATTMGR_USB_CHARGE_NOW		0x16
+
 #define BATTMGR_WLS_PROPERTY_GET	0x34
 #define BATTMGR_WLS_PROPERTY_SET	0x35
 #define WLS_ONLINE			0
@@ -884,7 +892,7 @@
 	}
 
 	mutex_lock(&battmgr->lock);
-	ret = qcom_battmgr_request_property(battmgr, BATTMGR_USB_PROPERTY_SET,
+	ret = qcom_battmgr_request_property(battmgr, BATTMGR_USB_CHARGE_NOW,
 					    USB_CHARGE_ENABLE, value);
 	mutex_unlock(&battmgr->lock);
 	if (!ret)
@@ -1755,7 +1763,7 @@
 	 */
 	if (battmgr->variant == QCOM_BATTMGR_SM8550 ||
 	    battmgr->variant == QCOM_BATTMGR_SM8350) {
-		qcom_battmgr_request_property(battmgr, BATTMGR_USB_PROPERTY_SET,
+		qcom_battmgr_request_property(battmgr, BATTMGR_USB_CHARGE_NOW,
 					      USB_CHARGE_ENABLE, 1);
 	}
 }
